blueZeroNm":400,"redZeroNm":970},"gen3-blue":{"blueZeroNm":300,"redZeroNm":980}},"site":"ESO Paranal; pwv=3.5 mm; msolflux=130 sfu; season=time=0; ecl_lon=135 / ecl_lat=90 deg; standard ESO aerosols; moon_earth_dist=1","limits":["ESO Paranal 固定站点/PWV/气溶胶；目标高度30–85°、月亮5–75°、月相角0–180°，月距必须符合几何；0–5°为工程渐消，地平线下为0。","月光为稀疏光谱表的对数插值；波长300–1100nm、0.2nm采样，滤镜带宽限制≥1nm；不是全几何高精度模型。","SQM响应与AB零点约定为assumed；显示的是模型等效SQM，无月输入不含新增月光，也不含M42/单颗星。","CIE灯谱仅380–780nm：经假设散射后定标；HP1为5nm粗采样，真实带外/NIR未验证；不以平谱填补。","阴极尾段、M42共同绝对亮度和理想光学为工程假设；目标只有7条线，连续谱/其他线仍缺失。","背景在5.87×4.91角分内视作均匀；无云、无暮光、无额外目标大气损失。","黄道参考经度135°/纬度90°固定，未随 M42 坐标和观测日期重算。此模板不是指定日期的 M42 现场天空预测。","单个独立校验点：月光加权积分差0.24–3.06%，自然高度插值差3.95–7.79%；1nm Hα的0.2/0.1nm采样差6.30%。这些不是全参数误差上限。"],"sources":[{"id":"S01","title":"ESO SkyCalc 2.0.9 / CLI 1.5 actual output","category":["environment"],"localPath":null,"url":"https://www.eso.org/observing/etc/doc/skycalc/helpskycalc.html","sha256":null,"pageCount":null,"review":"web-reviewed","evidence":"Actual FITS columns/units checked; input parameters and SHA256 in downloads.json. No source paper digitization.","limitation":"Paranal, PWV3.5mm, msolflux130, averaged season/night; default aerosols. Sparse interpolation is an engineering approximation.","licence":"Attribution retained; redistribution terms require review before publication."},{"id":"S02","title":"Noll et al. 2012, A&A 543 A92","category":["environment"],"localPath":null,"url":"https://doi.org/10.1051/0004-6361/201219040","sha256":null,"pageCount":null,"review":"web-reviewed","evidence":"Underlying ESO sky model cited by actual FITS header.","limitation":"Model, not site-specific measurement.","licence":"Attribution retained; redistribution terms require review before publication."},{"id":"S03","title":"Jones et al. 2013, A&A 560 A91","category":["environment"],"localPath":null,"url":"https://doi.org/10.1051/0004-6361/201322433","sha256":null,"pageCount":null,"review":"web-reviewed","evidence":"Underlying scattered-moonlight spectral model cited by actual FITS header.","limitation":"No arbitrary-city aerosol/cloud prediction; phase 0=full.","licence":"Attribution retained; redistribution terms require review before publication."},{"id":"S04","title":"CIE typical LED lamp spectra, 1nm","category":["environment"],"localPath":null,"url":"https://doi.org/10.25039/CIE.DS.dhcw57sd","sha256":null,"pageCount":null,"review":"web-reviewed","evidence":"Downloaded original LED-B1/B5, verified metadata MD5 and SHA256.","limitation":"Relative lamps, 380–780nm; not observed sky.","licence":"CIE 2018, CC BY-SA 4.0; numerical adaptations retain attribution and same licence."},{"id":"S05","title":"CIE high-pressure lamp spectra","category":["environment"],"localPath":null,"url":"https://doi.org/10.25039/CIE.DS.f6rvvnev","sha256":null,"pageCount":null,"review":"web-reviewed","evidence":"Downloaded original HP1, verified metadata-v2 MD5/SHA256.","limitation":"5nm sodium lamp sampling does not resolve individual Na lines or real NIR.","licence":"CIE 2018, CC BY-SA 4.0; numerical adaptations retain attribution and same licence."},{"id":"S06","title":"Unihedron SQM-L + Sánchez de Miguel et al. 2017","category":["environment"],"localPath":null,"url":"https://unihedron.com/projects/sqm-l/","sha256":null,"pageCount":null,"review":"web-reviewed","evidence":"Manufacturer documents visual response/IR blocking; colour-dependent interpretation: https://arxiv.org/abs/1701.05019 .","limitation":"No measured instrument response extracted; this simulator response is explicitly assumed.","licence":"Attribution retained; redistribution terms require review before publication."},{"id":"S07","title":"D16/D21–D23 engineering assumptions","category":["environment"],"localPath":null,"url":"https://github.com/S0utherN/NvFilterSimulator","sha256":null,"pageCount":null,"review":"web-reviewed","evidence":"User permits estimated presets; explicit QE endpoints, SQM response, ideal optics and lamp scattering.","limitation":"Not measured data, no absolute tube calibration.","licence":"Attribution retained; redistribution terms require review before publication."},{"id":"S08","title":"SDSS AB flux calibration definition","category":["environment"],"localPath":null,"url":"https://www.sdss3.org/dr8/algorithms/fluxcal.php","sha256":null,"pageCount":null,"review":"web-reviewed","evidence":"AB magnitude zero uses 3631 Jy; 1Jy=1e-26 W/m2/Hz.","limitation":"Applying AB zero to assumed SQM response is a simulator convention, not factory SQM calibration.","licence":"Attribution retained; redistribution terms require review before publication."}]}
